WEBVTT

50:32.014 --> 50:35.684
- What are you doing here?
- I might ask the same of you.

50:35.809 --> 50:37.894
What is it you hope to accomplish?

50:38.020 --> 50:40.856
The king called on me
to serve him and the realm,

50:40.981 --> 50:43.317
and that's what I'll do
until he tells me otherwise.

50:43.442 --> 50:46.111
You can't change him.
You can't help him.

50:46.236 --> 50:48.864
He'll do what he wants,
which is all he's ever done.

50:48.989 --> 50:51.742
You'll try your best
to pick up the pieces.

50:51.867 --> 50:54.453
If that's my job, then so be it.

50:56.079 --> 50:58.415
You're just a soldier, aren't you?

50:58.540 --> 51:02.169
You take your orders
and you carry on.
